            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Contributions to Drug Discovery</strong><br>\nBlack's methodology in drug discovery, emphasizing the importance of understanding disease mechanisms, has influenced the pharmaceutical industry and medical research.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Legacy in Medicine</strong><br>\nBlack's contributions to medical science have saved countless lives and his legacy continues in the principles of drug discovery and the ongoing development of new medicines.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Death and Remembrance</strong><br>\nJames Black passed away on March 21, 2010. He is remembered as a scientist who made monumental contributions to medicine and pharmacology. His work changed the face of modern medicine and his influence is felt in the industry to this day.</p>\n"
              },
